vigilkit plugin-dahua

This product includes software developed by vigilkit contributors
(https://github.com/SnowCrescenter-tech/vigilkit). This package is licensed
under the Apache License 2.0; see LICENSE.

The Dahua HTTP CGI protocol (the cgi-bin endpoints), the RTSP URL templates
(/cam/realmonitor), and the RTSP-over-WebSocket bridge (/rtspoverwebsocket)
are implemented from public protocol documentation (see
docs/vendor-sdk-research.md section 2). No Dahua SDK binaries and no
third-party source code are vendored, copied, or linked into this package;
it has zero runtime dependencies.

The Apache-2.0 license applies only to the code written by vigilkit
contributors; it does not apply to any Dahua device firmware or SDK.
